  <Sequence sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText="- Overview （輸入檔單位轉換）「參照儲存內部單位的Excel檔，把要用於BAPI註冊的Excel檔裡描述的單位，轉換成SAP內部單位。」&#xA;Refer to the Excel file that stores the internal unit of measurement,&#xA;The unit of measure described in the Excel file for BAPI registration is converted to the internal unit of measure.&#xA;&#xA;- Argument&#xA;   in_ConvertFilePath as Target file path to convert&lt;String&gt;&#xA;   in_UomFilePath as Internal unit of measure conversion table file path&lt;String&gt;&#xA;   in_UomSheetName as Internal unit of measure conversion sheet name&lt;String&gt;" DisplayName="SRC_INPUT_FILE_VAL_CNV_E" sap:VirtualizedContainerService.HintSize="1056,1472" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="Sequence_4">
